new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ae40b94
--- /dev/null
+++ b/harness/verification/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# Verification maintenance contract
+
+The existing root pre-push gate remains authoritative. A passing local typecheck does not
+replace lint, source reconstruction, runtime tests or platform release verification.
+
+## Behavior-preserving module splits
+
+- `apiKeyPlanUsage.ts` owns credential selection, request routing and the revision-scoped
+  cache. Its pure response parsers live in `apiKeyPlanUsageParsers.ts` and remain exported
+  from the original entry. No endpoint, account policy, payload interpretation, timeout,
+  cache or returned status changes with this extraction.
+- `pluginManagementStore.ts` remains the only plugin view state owner. Grant/revoke actions
+  are assembled in `pluginManagementStoreGrants.ts` using its existing `set`/`get` and
+  `runWorkspaceOperation`; no second store, service writer or loading lifecycle is added.
+
+Grant/revoke event order stays:
+
+```text
+store action → runWorkspaceOperation captures workspace/identity/scope
+             → existing service operation → existing scoped reload → existing store
+```
+
+The same failure, context-change and operation-version guards apply to desktop and web.
+No persistence format or migration changes. Existing parser/request tests, grant/revoke
+scope and failure tests, typecheck, lint and architecture checks verify the extraction.
